 "title": "CSS Shorthand Border Property",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "type": "h1",
   "text": "CSS Shorthand Border Property"
  },
  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "CSS Border - Shorthand Property"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Like you saw in the previous page, there are many properties to consider when dealing with borders."
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "To shorten the code, it is also possible to specify all the individual border properties in\none property."
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "The\nborder property is a shorthand property for the following individual border properties:"
  },
  {
   "type": "list",
   "ordered": false,
   "items": [
    "border-width",
    "border-style (required)",
    "border-color"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": "p {\n\nborder: 5px solid red;\n}",
   "caption": "Example"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_border"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "You can also specify all the individual border properties for just one side:"
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": "p {\n\nborder-left: 6px solid red;\n}",
   "caption": "Left Border"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_border_left"
  },
  {
   "type": "code",
   "lang": "css",
   "text": "p {\n\nborder-bottom: 6px solid red;\n}",
   "caption": "Bottom Border"
  },
  {
   "type": "tryit",
   "url": "https://www.w3schools.com/tryit.asp?filename=trycss_border_bottom"
  }
 ]
}